Aside from the excellent advice already offered, one hint is to remember that
you have time to think before reacting to a monster attack.  (I think this a
point mentioned in the NH beginners' guide posted here somewhere.)  Check your
inventory.  As a last ditch, it is worth using some unidentified items.  That
ring of regeneration might have saved you, or digging down and jumping to the
level below (a bad idea if you are burdened or strained).

With an Exp lvl 10 Valk, you should have been able to make it to Minetown
without much trouble.  There are a lot of shops there with items you need, plus
the opporunity to visit a temple.  Even if it is not of your alignment, the
priest may reward you if you make a suitable donation.

The Sokoban levels also have some valuable items.  I used graph paper to work
out the last few levels.

Looking forward to seeing YAAP from you!

